#: ../../source/features/model-serving/heterogeneous-gpu.rst:5
msgid "Heterogeneous GPU Inference"
msgstr "异构 GPU 推理"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/heterogeneous-gpu.rst:7
msgid ""
"Heterogeneous GPU Inference is a feature that enables users to utilize "
"different types of GPUs for deploying the same model. This feature "
"addresses two primary challenges associated with Large Language Model "
"(LLM) inference: (1) As the demand for large-scale model inference "
"increases, ensuring consistent GPU availability has become a challenge, "
"particularly within regions where identical GPU types are often "
"unavailable due to capacity constraints. (2) Users may seek to "
"incorporate lower-cost, lower-performance GPUs to reduce overall "
"expenses."
msgstr ""
"异构 GPU 推理允许使用不同类型的 GPU "
"部署同一模型。该特性针对大语言模型（LLM）推理中的两个主要问题：（1）随着大规模模型推理需求增长，保证 GPU "
"供应一致变得困难，尤其在容量受限、同类型 GPU 经常不可用的区域。（2）用户可能希望引入成本更低、性能较低的 GPU 以降低总体费用。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/heterogeneous-gpu.rst:9
msgid ""
"This page has two parts. `Load-Balance Routing Across GPU Types`_ "
"describes the capacity-aware routing algorithm that spreads requests "
"across replicas of different speeds. `GPU Optimizer and SLO Routing "
"(experimental)`_ describes the optimizer-driven deployment workflow and "
"the SLO-aware routing policy that the heterogeneous feature provides "
"today."
msgstr ""
"本页分为两部分。 `Load-Balance Routing Across GPU Types`_ "
"介绍在不同速度的副本之间分摊请求的容量感知路由算法。 `GPU Optimizer and SLO Routing "
"(experimental)`_ 介绍异构特性目前提供的、由 optimizer 驱动的部署流程以及 SLO 感知路由策略。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/heterogeneous-gpu.rst:12
msgid "Load-Balance Routing Across GPU Types"
msgstr "跨 GPU 类型的负载均衡路由"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/heterogeneous-gpu.rst:14
msgid ""
"Production GPU fleets are rarely homogeneous. When capacity on one GPU "
"type is exhausted, workloads may need to spill over to hardware with very"
" different performance characteristics. This breaks a basic assumption of"
" traditional load balancing: equal request counts do not mean equal load."
" Sending the same QPS to a faster and a slower GPU can overload one "
"deployment while leaving capacity unused on the other."
msgstr ""
"生产环境中的 GPU 集群很少是同构的。当某一类 GPU "
"的容量耗尽时，工作负载可能需要溢出到性能特征差异很大的硬件上。这打破了传统负载均衡的一个基本假设：请求数相等并不意味着负载相等。向更快和更慢的 "
"GPU 发送相同的 QPS，可能使一个 Deployment 过载，同时让另一个 Deployment 的容量闲置。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/heterogeneous-gpu.rst:16
msgid ""
"The ``load-balance`` routing strategy addresses this by scoring each "
"replica on its current load relative to its observed capacity and routing"
" the request to the replica with the lowest score. It needs no hardware "
"labels and no static table of GPU performance: a mixed pool teaches the "
"gateway its relative speeds from production traffic, and faster replicas "
"receive proportionally more requests."
msgstr ""
"``load-balance`` "
"路由策略通过依据每个副本当前负载与其观测容量的比值对副本打分，并将请求路由到得分最低的副本来解决该问题。它不需要硬件标签，也不需要静态的 GPU "
"性能表：网关会从生产流量中学习混合资源池中各副本的相对速度，更快的副本会按比例获得更多请求。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/heterogeneous-gpu.rst:19
msgid "Scoring"
msgstr "打分"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/heterogeneous-gpu.rst:21
msgid ""
"\\text{score} =\n"
"\\frac{\\text{running} + \\lambda \\cdot "
"\\text{queued}}{\\text{capacity}}\n"
"\\times\n"
"\\left( 1 + \\alpha \\, (1 - \\text{kvFree})^2 \\right)"
msgstr ""
"\\text{score} =\n"
"\\frac{\\text{running} + \\lambda \\cdot "
"\\text{queued}}{\\text{capacity}}\n"
"\\times\n"
"\\left( 1 + \\alpha \\, (1 - \\text{kvFree})^2 \\right)"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/heterogeneous-gpu.rst:28
msgid ""
"A lower score is a better routing candidate. The first term normalizes "
"the work already committed to a replica by how quickly that replica can "
"process it. The second term increasingly penalizes a replica as its free "
"KV-cache fraction shrinks. Capacity and load are deliberately kept apart:"
" a saturated GPU shows high token throughput *because* it is busy, so "
"throughput only sets the denominator and is never used as a measure of "
"load."
msgstr ""
"得分越低，越适合作为路由候选。第一项用副本处理工作的速度，对已分配给该副本的工作量做归一化。第二项则随着副本空闲 KV cache "
"比例的下降而逐渐加大惩罚。容量与负载被有意分开：处于饱和状态的 GPU 因为繁忙才表现出较高的 token "
"吞吐，因此吞吐量只作为分母，绝不用来衡量负载。"

