#: ../../source/features/model-serving/heterogeneous-gpu.rst:104
msgid "How Capacity Is Learned"
msgstr "容量如何学习"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/heterogeneous-gpu.rst:106
msgid ""
"Rather than relying on a static table of GPU performance, the gateway "
"learns each replica's capacity from the traffic it serves:"
msgstr "网关不依赖静态的 GPU 性能表，而是从自身服务的流量中学习每个副本的容量："

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/heterogeneous-gpu.rst:108
msgid ""
"The gateway counts the output tokens each replica completes. Because the "
"counter is kept by the gateway, it works for every engine (vLLM, SGLang, "
"TRT-LLM, xLLM) without depending on engine-specific metric names."
msgstr ""
"网关统计每个副本完成的输出 token 数。由于该计数器由网关维护，因此适用于所有引擎（vLLM、SGLang、TRT-"
"LLM、xLLM），无需依赖引擎特有的指标名称。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/heterogeneous-gpu.rst:109
msgid ""
"On every metrics refresh (default 1 second), the counter is converted to "
"tokens per second over a window of about one minute and smoothed with an "
"exponentially weighted moving average (time constant 10 seconds)."
msgstr "每次指标刷新（默认 1 秒）时，计数器会按约一分钟的窗口换算为每秒 token 数，并用指数加权移动平均（时间常数 10 秒）进行平滑。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/heterogeneous-gpu.rst:110
msgid ""
"A window with no completed tokens carries no information about speed, "
"because the replica was idle rather than slow. The previous estimate is "
"kept instead of decaying toward zero, so a briefly idle replica is not "
"starved of the traffic that would re-measure it."
msgstr ""
"没有完成任何 token "
"的窗口不包含速度信息，因为此时副本是空闲而非缓慢。此时保留之前的估计值，而不是向零衰减，这样短暂空闲的副本就不会因此失去能重新测量它的流量。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/heterogeneous-gpu.rst:111
msgid ""
"A new replica with no estimate yet is scored at the mean estimate of the "
"replicas that have one, so it competes as an average replica until enough"
" measurements arrive. If no replica has an estimate, all replicas get the"
" same capacity and the score reduces to load multiplied by the KV "
"penalty."
msgstr ""
"尚无估计值的新副本，按已有估计值的副本的平均值打分，因此在收集到足够测量数据之前，它会作为一个平均水平的副本参与竞争。如果所有副本都没有估计值，则所有副本容量相同，得分退化为负载乘以"
" KV 惩罚项。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/heterogeneous-gpu.rst:113
msgid ""
"The learned value is the *observed serving capacity under the current "
"workload mix*, not a fixed property of the GPU. Request shape can "
"materially change throughput even on identical hardware, particularly for"
" input-heavy and multimodal workloads, and the estimate moves with the "
"mix. Because it follows a window of about one minute, a sudden change "
"shows up within tens of seconds rather than immediately."
msgstr ""
"学习到的值是 *当前工作负载组合下观测到的服务容量* ，而不是 GPU "
"的固有属性。即使在相同硬件上，请求形态也会显著影响吞吐，尤其是输入较长和多模态的工作负载，估计值会随负载组合而变化。由于它跟随约一分钟的窗口，突变会在几十秒内体现，而不是立即体现。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/heterogeneous-gpu.rst:116
msgid "Production Results"
msgstr "生产环境效果"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/heterogeneous-gpu.rst:118
msgid ""
"The figure and table below show two GPU types serving the same model, "
"before and after capacity-aware routing was rolled out. Before, a least-"
"request style strategy sent roughly the same QPS to both deployments, so "
"the slower GPU was overloaded while the faster GPU was underutilized. "
"After, the gateway sent more traffic to the faster GPU and utilization "
"converged."
msgstr ""
"下方的图和表展示了同一模型在两种 GPU 类型上，容量感知路由上线前后的对比。上线前，类似 least-request 的策略向两个 "
"Deployment 发送大致相同的 QPS，导致较慢的 GPU 过载，而较快的 GPU 利用率不足。上线后，网关向较快的 GPU "
"发送了更多流量，利用率趋于一致。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/heterogeneous-gpu.rst:120
msgid "Capacity-aware routing aligns GPU utilization across different GPU types"
msgstr "容量感知路由使不同 GPU 类型的利用率趋于一致"

