#: ../../source/features/model-serving/heterogeneous-gpu.rst:145
msgid ""
"Balanced load does not mean equal request counts. In a heterogeneous "
"fleet, routing should distribute work according to the capacity available"
" to process it rather than dividing traffic evenly. Faster GPUs naturally"
" take more requests, utilization converges across GPU types, and overall "
"cluster throughput improves without overloading the slower GPUs."
msgstr ""
"均衡的负载并不意味着请求数相等。在异构集群中，路由应当按各自处理工作的可用容量来分配工作，而不是平均分摊流量。较快的 GPU "
"自然承接更多请求，不同 GPU 类型的利用率趋于一致，整体集群吞吐提升，同时不会让较慢的 GPU 过载。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/heterogeneous-gpu.rst:148
msgid "Using Load-Balance Routing"
msgstr "使用 load-balance 路由"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/heterogeneous-gpu.rst:150
msgid ""
"Replicas of one model, such as one ``Deployment`` per GPU type that share"
" the same ``model.aibrix.ai/name`` label, are scored together. Select the"
" strategy explicitly with the ``routing-strategy`` request header:"
msgstr ""
"同一模型的各副本（例如每种 GPU 类型一个 ``Deployment`` 且共享相同的 ``model.aibrix.ai/name`` "
"标签）会放在一起打分。通过 ``routing-strategy`` 请求头显式选择该策略："

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/heterogeneous-gpu.rst:165
msgid ""
"``load-balance`` is also blended in behind other strategies by default, "
"so its scoring influences most requests even when it is not selected "
"explicitly. See *Auto-blended capacity awareness* in :doc:`../gateway-"
"routing/gateway-plugins` and "
"``AIBRIX_ROUTING_AUTO_BLEND_LOAD_BALANCE_WEIGHT``."
msgstr ""
"``load-balance`` 默认也会混合在其他策略之后，因此即使没有显式选择，它的打分也会影响大多数请求。详见 :doc"
":`../gateway-routing/gateway-plugins` 中的 *Auto-blended capacity "
"awareness* 和 ``AIBRIX_ROUTING_AUTO_BLEND_LOAD_BALANCE_WEIGHT`` 。"

