msgid ""
"Treated as fully free: no penalty and no guardrail, so engines that lack "
"the metric are not penalized."
msgstr "视为完全空闲：既无惩罚也无保护阈值，因此缺少该指标的引擎不会被惩罚。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/heterogeneous-gpu.rst:180
msgid "``kvFree < kvCritical``"
msgstr "``kvFree < kvCritical``"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/heterogeneous-gpu.rst:181
msgid ""
"Score is ``+Inf``. When ``load-balance`` routes alone, the replica is "
"skipped until it recovers. When ``load-balance`` is blended with other "
"strategies, ``+Inf`` is only a strong penalty: another strategy that "
"scores the replica highly can still select it."
msgstr ""
"得分为 ``+Inf`` 。当 ``load-balance`` 单独路由时，该副本会被跳过，直到恢复。当 ``load-balance`` "
"与其他策略混合时， ``+Inf`` 只是较强的惩罚：对该副本打高分的其他策略仍可能选中它。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/heterogeneous-gpu.rst:182
msgid "Every replica is below ``kvCritical``"
msgstr "所有副本都低于 ``kvCritical``"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/heterogeneous-gpu.rst:183
msgid ""
"The request does not fail. It is routed to the replica with the most KV "
"headroom."
msgstr "请求不会失败，而是路由到 KV 余量最多的副本。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/heterogeneous-gpu.rst:184
msgid "Replica is idle (``running = 0``)"
msgstr "副本空闲（ ``running = 0`` ）"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/heterogeneous-gpu.rst:185
msgid "Score is ``0`` regardless of capacity, so idle replicas are preferred."
msgstr "无论容量如何，得分均为 ``0`` ，因此空闲副本优先。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/heterogeneous-gpu.rst:186
msgid "Several replicas share the lowest score"
msgstr "多个副本得分并列最低"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/heterogeneous-gpu.rst:187
msgid ""
"Ties are broken by least combined GPU and CPU KV-cache usage, then at "
"random."
msgstr "并列时按 GPU 与 CPU 合计 KV cache 使用量最少者优先，仍并列则随机选择。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/heterogeneous-gpu.rst:190
msgid "Known Limitations"
msgstr "已知限制"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/heterogeneous-gpu.rst:192
msgid ""
"**Load-imbalance gate ignores capacity.** The gateway applies a load-"
"imbalance gate ahead of whichever strategy routes the request. It "
"compares raw running-request counts, so a faster replica that "
"legitimately carries more concurrent requests can be flagged as a hotspot"
" and excluded before the capacity-aware score is computed."
msgstr ""
"**负载不均衡门限忽略容量。** "
"网关会在任何策略路由请求之前先应用负载不均衡门限。该门限比较的是原始的运行中请求数，因此，本就应承载更多并发请求的较快副本可能被判定为热点，并在计算容量感知得分之前被排除。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/heterogeneous-gpu.rst:193
msgid ""
"**Single output-token rate.** Capacity is not split into prefill and "
"decode throughput, so hardware whose relative performance differs between"
" prompt-heavy and decode-heavy workloads is not modeled. Requests that "
"report no output tokens add nothing to the estimate, so a pool that "
"serves only such requests has no capacity signal and replicas are scored "
"on load and KV pressure alone."
msgstr ""
"**单一的输出 token 速率。** 容量没有拆分为 prefill 与 decode 吞吐，因此在偏 prompt 与偏 decode "
"的工作负载上相对性能不同的硬件无法被建模。不上报输出 token "
"的请求不会对估计值产生贡献，因此只服务此类请求的资源池没有容量信号，副本仅按负载和 KV 压力打分。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/heterogeneous-gpu.rst:194
msgid ""
"**Multiple gateway replicas.** The token counter is local to each gateway"
" while the running count is the cross-gateway total, so each gateway "
"measures roughly ``1/N`` of a replica's output. Relative ranking is "
"preserved when the gateways spread traffic similarly, but absolute score "
"values are not comparable across deployments with different gateway "
"counts."
msgstr ""
"**多个网关副本。** token 计数器是各网关本地的，而运行中请求数是跨网关的总数，因此每个网关大约只能测得副本输出的 ``1/N`` "
"。当各网关分流流量相近时，相对排序得以保留，但在网关数量不同的部署之间，绝对得分不可比较。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/heterogeneous-gpu.rst:195
msgid ""
"**Not used on purpose.** GPU utilization and SM-active are useful for "
"observability but make a generic scheduler unstable, so the score uses "
"only drain rate, committed work, and KV pressure."
msgstr ""
"**有意不使用。** GPU 利用率和 SM-active 对可观测性有用，但会让通用调度器不稳定，因此得分只使用排空速率、已分配工作量和 KV "
"压力。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/heterogeneous-gpu.rst:198
msgid "GPU Optimizer and SLO Routing (experimental)"
msgstr "GPU Optimizer 与 SLO 路由（实验性）"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/heterogeneous-gpu.rst:200
msgid ""
"The sections below describe what the heterogeneous GPU feature provides "
"today beyond load-balance routing: the GPU optimizer, which decides how "
"many replicas of each GPU type to run, and the SLO-aware routing policy."
msgstr ""
"以下各节介绍除 load-balance 路由之外，异构 GPU 特性目前提供的能力：GPU optimizer（决定每种 GPU "
"类型运行多少副本）和 SLO 感知路由策略。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/heterogeneous-gpu.rst:203
msgid "Design Overview"
msgstr "设计概览"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/heterogeneous-gpu.rst:205
msgid ""
"There are three main components in Heterogeneous GPU Inference Feature: "
"(1) LLM Request Monitoring, (2) Heterogeneous GPU Optimizer, (3) Request "
"Routing. The following figure shows the overall architecture. First, LLM "
"Request Monitoring component is responsible for monitoring the past "
"inference requests and their request patterns. Second, Heterogeneous GPU "
"Optimizer component is responsible for selecting the optimal GPU type and"
" the corresponding GPU count. Third, Request Routing component is "
"responsible for routing the request to the optimal GPU."
msgstr ""
"异构 GPU 推理包含三个主要组件：（1）LLM 请求监控，（2）异构 GPU Optimizer，（3）请求路由。下图展示整体架构。首先，LLM"
" 请求监控负责观察历史推理请求及其模式。其次，异构 GPU Optimizer 负责选择最优 GPU "
"类型及对应数量。第三，请求路由负责将请求路由到最优 GPU。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/heterogeneous-gpu.rst:207
msgid "heterogeneous-gpu-diagram"
msgstr "heterogeneous-gpu-diagram"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/heterogeneous-gpu.rst:213
msgid ""
"This feature is the heterogeneous form of :doc:`../scaling-"
"performance/autoscaling/optimizer-based-autoscaling`: the same GPU "
"optimizer, fed one benchmark profile per GPU type, decides how many "
"replicas of each type to run. Read that page first for the request-"
"tracing and profiling workflow; this page covers what is specific to "
"mixing GPU types."
msgstr ""
"该特性是 :doc:`../scaling-performance/autoscaling/optimizer-based-"
"autoscaling` 的异构形态：同一 GPU optimizer 为每种 GPU 类型提供一份基准 "
"profile，并据此决定各类型运行多少副本。请先阅读该页了解请求追踪与 profiling 流程；本页仅说明混用 GPU 类型时的差异。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/heterogeneous-gpu.rst:219
msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr "前置条件"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/heterogeneous-gpu.rst:221
msgid ""
"One ``Deployment`` per GPU type, all carrying the same "
"``model.aibrix.ai/name`` label and each pinned to its GPU type through "
"node selectors or affinity. The gateway treats them as one model."
msgstr ""
"每种 GPU 类型对应一个 ``Deployment`` ，均带有相同的 ``model.aibrix.ai/name`` "
"标签，并通过节点选择器或亲和性绑定到对应 GPU 类型。网关将其视为同一模型。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/heterogeneous-gpu.rst:224
msgid ""
"One ``PodAutoscaler`` per deployment, each reading the optimizer's metric"
" for its own deployment."
msgstr "每个 Deployment 对应一个 ``PodAutoscaler`` ，各自读取 optimizer 针对该 Deployment 的指标。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/heterogeneous-gpu.rst:226
msgid ""
"Request tracing enabled on the gateway plugin and the ``aibrix`` Python "
"package installed locally for benchmarking, as described in :doc"
":`../scaling-performance/autoscaling/optimizer-based-autoscaling`."
msgstr ""
"网关插件已启用请求追踪，并且本机已安装用于基准测试的 ``aibrix`` Python 包，详见 :doc:`../scaling-"
"performance/autoscaling/optimizer-based-autoscaling` 。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/heterogeneous-gpu.rst:228
msgid ""
"For SLO-aware routing across the GPU types, profiling data for each "
"workload on each GPU type (see `Routing Support`_)."
msgstr ""
"若要在 GPU 类型之间做 SLO 感知路由，需要每种工作负载在每种 GPU 类型上的 profiling 数据（见 `Routing "
"Support`_ ）。"

