msgid ""
"The shared model name. Must match the ``model`` used when profiles were "
"stored."
msgstr "共享模型名。必须与存储 profile 时使用的 ``model`` 一致。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/heterogeneous-gpu.rst:353
