"``load-balance`` strategy described above."
msgstr ""
"性能评估中发现，现有路由策略未能充分反映异构 GPU "
"不同的服务能力。下图表明当前路由策略无法满足指定的服务水平目标（SLO）。该评估早于上文所述的容量感知 ``load-balance`` 策略。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/heterogeneous-gpu.rst:370
#: ../../source/features/model-serving/heterogeneous-gpu.rst:402
#: ../../source/features/model-serving/heterogeneous-gpu.rst:415
