msgstr "SLO 路由动机图"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/heterogeneous-gpu.rst:375
msgid "The experimental configuration is as follows:"
msgstr "实验配置如下："

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/heterogeneous-gpu.rst:377
